am/apps/3603870/extras/b563e1310e169b33fd2050b46b5e6993.poster.avif?t=1770885238\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/b563e1310e169b33fd2050b46b5e6993.webm?t=1770885238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/b563e1310e169b33fd2050b46b5e6993.mp4?t=1770885238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your workforce progress from slow beginners to lightning-fast pros. Equip them with hats and upgrades as you expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/4927ca8584033611d9b43b539172d89f.poster.avif?t=1770885238\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/4927ca8584033611d9b43b539172d89f.webm?t=1770885238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/4927ca8584033611d9b43b539172d89f.mp4?t=1770885238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the quirky narrative of your raccoon team as they work their way up the trash business ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/570ba3c1f7d60cbba2047295f3342d8a.avif?t=1770885238\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras_big/570ba3c1f7d60cbba2047295f3342d8a.avif?t=1770885238 width=1560 height=704 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrate with Twitch to let your chat control your raccoons</p>",
